# =============================================================================
# NovaiOS — Linux kernel configuration (x86_64)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base:    defconfig for x86_64 (Linux 6.12 LTS)
# Tweaks:  Rust-for-Linux enabled, full driver tree for AMD/NVIDIA/Intel,
#          squashfs + overlayfs for the live ISO, Wayland/KMS, modern input,
#          container runtime support, full firmware loading.
#
# This file is fed to `make olddefconfig` after copying to .config. Missing
# symbols fall back to defconfig defaults — that's intentional so the build
# stays robust across kernel point releases.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rust-for-Linux (CONFIG_RUST=y requires rustc + bindgen + LLVM)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
